  m_text: 'X is the universal spacebrake. It will automatically cut throttles and
    use thrusters to bring you to a stop (Including spin). If used alongside other
    controls, it will not touch those axes.


    Backspace will reset a level. You
    wil start at the countdown again. No need to continue an attempt where you already
    crashed!


    When in a level, using Escape will immediately bring you back
    to the main menu.'
